== ADR-0017: a slice index outside the slice bounds traps, even when it is
== inside the array.
Module Runtime.SliceIndexOutOfBounds

Main :
    A Array[1..5] Integer
    S := A[2..3]
    I Integer := 3
    I += 1
    PutLn(S[I])
;
